/**
 * SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for the brand asset inventory.
 * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * Plain-JS (.mjs) so it can be consumed by BOTH:
 *   - the React app  (src/data/brand-assets.ts re-exports these with types)
 *   - the Node audit (scripts/check-brand-consistency.mjs imports directly)
 *
 * Every downloadable, user-facing asset MUST have an entry here. The audit
 * script cross-checks this registry against the generated files on disk, the
 * asset-index.json manifest, the ZIP package, and the site favicon metadata,
 * and fails CI on any divergence. Do not maintain a second hard-coded list.
 */

